# Tiff AI Web 💻  

The **React-based web interface** for Tiff AI.  
Provides both customer-facing shopping assistant and vendor dashboards.  

## ✨ Features  
- 🛒 Smart AI-powered shopping assistant  
- 📊 Vendor dashboard with sales insights  
- 🌍 Localization for African markets  
- 🎨 Beautiful UI built with TailwindCSS + Shadcn  

## 🛠 Tech Stack  
- React, TailwindCSS, Shadcn UI  
- Node.js backend (Tiff AI Core)  
- Firebase / AWS for hosting  

## 🚀 Getting Started  

```bash
git clone https://github.com/castro901-art/tiff-ai-web.git
cd tiff-ai-web
npm install
npm run dev
